*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Internal docs / scratch — authoring notes, plans, specs that must never
# ship with the published repo. Only Root-level CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md are
# ignored; the shipped skill at src/pland_cli/skills/AGENTS.md stays tracked.
docs/superpowers/
.claude/
.agent-notes/
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md

# Local git worktrees for isolated development
.worktrees/
